.SH HISTORY
4BSD (1980)
introduced
.I \%waddch
and its variants.
.PP
SVr3 (1987)
added the
.I \%echochar
and
.I \%wechochar
functions and most of the
.I ACS_
constants,
except for
.IR \%ACS_GEQUAL ","
.IR \%ACS_LEQUAL ","
.IR \%ACS_NEQUAL ","
.IR \%ACS_PI ","
.IR \%ACS_S3 ","
.IR \%ACS_S7 ","
and
.IR \%ACS_STERLING "."
.PP
.I \%ncurses
1.9.6 (1995)
furnished the remaining
.I ACS_
constants.
